<title>USA: Mail Boxes hires an operating chief.</title>
<headline>Mail Boxes hires an operating chief.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mail Boxes Etc said Wednesday it named James Amos Jr as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Amos' most recent assignment was as president and chief executive officer of Brice Group, franchisor of I Can't Believe It's Yogurt!</p>
<p>He will report directly to A.W. (Tony) DeSio, Mail Boxes Etc's founder, vice chairman and chief executive officer. DeSio, until now, has been serving both as chief operating officer and chief executive officer, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
